---
description: Require authenticated internal Trace for every online AI assistant execution
alwaysApply: true
---

Every online AI assistant case executed in `test` or `pre` must be enriched with authenticated business-agent Trace before the run is considered complete or its report is published. Local fixture-only cases are excluded.

For every executed online case, require a non-empty `metadata.trace_runs` containing the internal Run ID and the available workflow, Skill, tool call/result, model, Prompt, event, usage, and status summaries. Public assistant SSE alone is insufficient.

If Trace enrichment fails or remains missing, preserve the business answer for diagnosis but fail the execution/publish gate. Never interpret missing Trace as “the Agent called no tools”; label it as “internal Trace not captured”. Prefer read-only backfill from the recorded Session ID before rerunning the user question.

Load Trace credentials from protected environment configuration and never persist passwords, flow tokens, bearer tokens, or raw secrets in evidence or reports.
